[style name="Interaction_Style"]
join Thorinn (normal) leftmost
if {Hugo.Followed_to_rockfall} == false:
	Thorinn: This must be Ian's inn.
	*knock knock*
	join Hugo rightmost
	Hugo: Look who we have here, seems like you've found your way.
Hugo: Come on in I'll get you your room ready.
leave --All--
[signal arg="start_night"]
[wait time="2.0"]
*Thorinn spends the night at the inn*
[signal arg="change_to_day_light"]
[signal arg="end-night"]
[wait time="2.0"]
join Thorinn leftmost
join Hugo rightmost
Hugo: Morning, traveler! How was your sleep?
Thorinn: It was good. The bed was a welcome change after spending days in the woods.
Hugo: Glad to hear. What brings you to Rockfall?
Thorinn: Mhhh...
Thorinn: I’m a doctor. I thought a remote village like this might benefit from my skills. Medical knowledge can be hard to come by in places like this.
Hugo: Hmm...what a coincidence. Our pharmacist has fallen ill, perhaps\
you could visit him. See if there’s anything you can do to help?
Thorinn: I’d be happy to help. Where can I find him?
Hugo: The pharmacy is the building across the river.you will recogise it by the sign by  the door. The door’s always open.
Hugo: Tell Ian I sent you, he’ll trust you more that way.
Thorinn (surprised): Why wouldn’t he trust me?
Hugo: This town doesn’t welcome strangers easily. You’ll see soon enough.
[signal arg="Start_Find_Ian"]
